<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MARCORP OFFERS KUDU MINORITIES 100 CTS/SHR.</title>
<headline>MARCORP OFFERS KUDU MINORITIES 100 CTS/SHR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marlin Corp Ltd (Marcorp) said on Wednesday it will pay minority shareholders in Kudu Granite Holdings Ltd 100 cents a share for their Kudu stocks.</p>
<p>This offer follows the purchase by Marcorp of 56.2 percent of Kudu and the consequent change of control in Kudu announced in December last year.</p>
<p>Kudu shares closed at 95 cents each on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange on June 9.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
